      "username": "kitmehsu",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kitmehsu/{size}/1901_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-07-29T09:29:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well for one, tachyons deck will eventually run out from the forced discards, meaning the trash is shuffled back into her deck, and with no burst cards in the trash, the combo stalls, so with the ideal situation of only 1 burst card in the trash when you start and a burst always discarded you can usually only do about 10 damage on a run through you deck. Good but far from infinite.&nbsp;</p>",
