      "raw": "[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n\nAll of the reactions (damage+discard) from PL626 would happen at the end of your string of powers, not in the midst.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThat. See also: Pride and Prejudice. Using Prejudice&#39;s power is part of Pride&#39;s power, so effects such as PL626 trigger only after both guns have been fired. In the same way, each instance of Blitz is embedded in the one that triggered it, so they only trigger PL626 at the end, one after the other.\n",
