      "created_at": "2016-07-29T11:46:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I knew I was missing something! I think I got overly excited.</p><p>I still think that comboing the three Fleets of Foot and Quick Insight would work. It would be useless against DR, but the idea of The Scholar, or Haka getting three extra cards per turn late game fills me with glee.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
